 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Amazon Verified Permissions API (2021-12-01). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Policy stores are configuration metadata: no Cedar policy, template, schema or identity source is stored and no authorization request is evaluated. IsAuthorized, IsAuthorizedWithToken, their batch forms, policies, policy templates, schemas and identity sources return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501. deletionProtection ENABLED is refused; GetPolicyStore always includes tags, and deleting a missing policy store returns ResourceNotFoundException instead of succeeding.",
  "title": "Amazon Verified Permissions (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2021-12-01"
 },
